BARANGAY HEALTH SERVICES

A. MEDICAL SERVICES (CONSULTATION)
    Eligibility Requirements:
       The applicant must be a resident of the barangay and duly registered in the Barangay Census.
    Steps:
        Proceed to the Barangay Health District Clinic.
        Patient registration:
        New patients: Fill out a patient profile form.
        Existing patients: The attending health worker will retrieve the patient's existing folder from the filing cabinet. Present it to the attending health worker for updating of the patient's profile.
        Avail of the necessary medical consultation and services.
        Receive additional health briefings and medical supplies, if available.
        Obtain the schedule for the next visit, if necessary.

B. MATERNAL CARE (PRENATAL AND POSTNATAL SERVICES)
    Requirements:
        Proof of residency in the barangay, with the applicant duly registered in the Barangay Census.
        Current Community Tax Certificate (CTC).
    Steps:
        Proceed to the Barangay Health District Clinic.
        Patient registration:
        New patients: Fill out a patient profile form.
        Existing patients: The attending health worker will retrieve the patient's existing folder from the filing cabinet. Present it to the attending health worker for updating of the patient's profile.
        Avail of the necessary maternal care services.
        Receive additional health briefings and medical supplies, if available.
        Obtain the schedule for the next visit.

C. IMMUNIZATION SERVICES

    Available Immunization Services:
    
        Anti-measles vaccination
        Anti-polio vaccination
        BCG vaccination
        DPT vaccination
        Hepatitis B vaccination
            Requirements:
                Child's Monitoring Chart (Yellow Card or Baby/Child Health Book).
            Steps:
                Proceed to the Barangay Health District Clinic.
                Patient registration:
                New patients: Fill out a patient profile form.
                Existing patients: The attending health worker will retrieve the patient's existing folder from the filing cabinet. Present it to the attending health worker for updating of the patient's profile.
                Avail of the necessary immunization services.
                Receive additional health briefings and medical supplies, if available.
                Obtain the schedule for the next immunization visit.

D. DENTAL SERVICES
    Eligibility Requirements:
        The applicant must be a resident of the barangay and duly registered in the Barangay Census.
    Steps:
        Proceed to the Barangay Health District Clinic.
        Patient registration:
        New patients: Fill out a patient profile form.
        Existing patients: The attending health worker will retrieve the patient's existing folder from the filing cabinet.
        Ask the Dental Aide to provide the dental form.
        Undergo an oral examination and diagnosis.
        Pay the appropriate fee for the dental procedure.
        Avail of the necessary dental services.
        Follow the post-operative instructions provided by the dental personnel and obtain the schedule for the next visit, if necessary.
        Fees:
        Payment is required for the dental procedure.
        The specific fee amount is not specified in the current knowledge base.

E. VITAMIN A SUPPLEMENTATION AND DEWORMING TABLET DISTRIBUTION
    Eligibility Requirements:
        The applicant must be a resident of the barangay and duly registered in the Barangay Census.
    Steps:
        Barangay Health Workers (BHWs) conduct information dissemination in every Purok regarding the schedule of the "Garantisadong Pambata" program.
        Proceed to the Barangay Hall or Barangay Health District Clinic for Vitamin A supplementation and deworming services.
        Look for the Barangay Nutrition Scholar (BNS), Barangay Nutrition Action Officer (BNAO), or Barangay Health Worker (BHW) for registration and weight monitoring.
        Receive Vitamin A soft gel capsules and deworming tablets.